Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         xfce4-panel (>= 4.16)
Description: per-window background colours for the XFCE panel
 A GTK3 module loaded in-process by xfce4-panel that paints a chosen
 background colour behind individual tasklist window buttons, so several
 open windows of the same application can be told apart at a glance.
 .
 The module is installed but NOT enabled. Enabling it adds this module to
 the session's GTK module list, which persists across logins, so it is left
 as an explicit, reversible decision rather than something an install step
 does on the user's behalf.
